/*!
\page page_stfpdtriggerdetector StFpdTriggerDetector

\brief FPD trigger detector data: east/west ADC arrays and DSM layer outputs for forward π⁰ detection.

\section stfpdtriggerdetector_overview Overview
\c StFpdTriggerDetector stores data from the Forward Pion Detector (FPD), the
predecessor of the FMS.  The FPD had east and west lead-glass modules in north, south,
top, bottom, and pre-shower configurations.  Raw ADC values per tower and DSM
Layer-1/Layer-2 outputs are stored for each sub-module and beam direction.

\section stfpdtriggerdetector_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StFpdTriggerDetector
\endcode

\section stfpdtriggerdetector_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| UChar_t[49] | mEN | East North ADC values |
| UChar_t[49] | mES | East South ADC values |
| UChar_t[25] | mET | East Top ADC values |
| UChar_t[25] | mEB | East Bottom ADC values |
| UChar_t[7] | mEPN | East pre-shower North ADC |
| UChar_t[7] | mEPS | East pre-shower South ADC |
| *(similar)* | mWN..mWPS | West-side counterparts |
| UShort_t[] | layer1 | DSM Layer-1 output words |
| UShort_t[] | layer2 | DSM Layer-2 output words |

\section stfpdtriggerdetector_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `unsigned int adc(StBeamDirection, int nstbps, int tower) const` | ADC for direction/sub-module/tower |
| `unsigned short layer1(StBeamDirection, int nstbps, int board) const` | Layer-1 DSM word |
| `unsigned short layer2(StBeamDirection, int nstbps) const` | Layer-2 DSM word |
| `int numberOfTowers(int nstbps) const` | Towers in sub-module |
| `int numberOfModules() const` | Total FPD modules |

\section stfpdtriggerdetector_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StFpdTriggerDetector& fpd = event->triggerDetectorCollection()->fpd();
cout << "FPD east-north tower 0: " << fpd.adc(east, 0, 0) << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_sttriggerdetectorcollection
\see \ref page_stfmstriggerdetector
*/
